  "description": "Large One Bed Premium Apt \n\nApartments at Newmarket Yards are nearly full—book a viewing today before they’re snapped up.\n\nLooking for a place where luxury meets comfort and convenience where you can unwind, recharge, connect and socialize?\nThen don't look further! At Newmarket Yards, we are dedicated to crafting an exceptional living experience and we will help you shape the way you live and make it the life you deserve in Dublin's vibrant heart.\n \nWellbeing at your fingertips, indulge your wellness routine, whatever your mood:\n\n-\tState-of-the-art gym and yoga studio,\n-\tFitness-focused rooftop terrace,\n-\tExclusive outdoor Spa rooftop with sauna, jacuzzi, plunge pool,\n-\tLounge / Relaxation room,\n\nWork and connect in style in our exceptional co-working area with:\n\n-\tPrivate meeting room with video conferencing,\n-\tIndividual Zoom Pods,\n-\tBreak out spaces,\n-       Printer on site\n-\tSeamless high-speed Wi-Fi connectivity.\n\nSocialise and unwind with old and new friends:\n\n-\tOnsite café,\n-\tCinema room,\n-\tGames room,\n-\tResidents' lounge with pool table,\n-\tPrivate dining suite and kitchen,\n-\tMonthly gatherings and weekly complimentary fitness classes\n-\t5 stunning rooftop terraces with breath-taking 360 degree views and tranquil wildflower gardens, spa terrace with jacuzzi, sauna and plunge pool, Fitness/ Gym Focused terrace, outdoor bar and BBQ and a dedicated dog exercise area.\n\nA Commitment to Sustainability\n\nAt Newmarket Yards, we believe in building for the future. Our A-rated, energy-efficient development is designed with the environment in mind, combining high performance with low impact. As part of our green vision, we offer:\n\n-\tElectric car charging stations,\n-\tSecure bike storages and a  convenient repair station,\n-\tRooftop beehives to support biodiversity and natural pollination,\n-\tWildflower gardens across our rooftop terraces,\n\nAnd to celebrate Planet Earth: Sign a lease for a one-bedroom apartment and receive a €1,000 bike voucher — because sustainable living should be rewarding.\nTerms and conditions apply.\n\nEmbrace the city buzz from our prime location.\n\nDublin is a vibrant mix of history and cool vibes. There's always a fresh discovery around the corner - a trendy bar, a hidden art gallery throughout cobblestone streets. In a nutshell, you'll find:\n\n-\tNeighbourhood distilleries, restaurants, cafes, and artist studios,\n-\tExplore trendy shops and landmarks live music venues,\n-\tExcellent public transport links - Numerous bus stops at your doorstep,\n-\tShort walk to St. Stephen's Green Park, Christ Church Cathedral and Guinness Storehouse.\n\nYour dream apartment awaits:\n\n-\tSpacious, light-filled, and stylish interiors,\n-\tModern and contemporary apartments across three blocks, reaching the eleventh floor,\n-\tOpen-plan kitchen, living, and dining area,\n-\tOne or two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes,\n-\tMain bathroom, en-suite, and storage room,\n-\tHigh-quality finishes and bespoke fixtures throughout,\n-\tA-rated development,\n-\tMinimum 1 year Lease to make it your home,\n-\tPet Friendly.\n\nAdditional features:\n\n-\tBike storage,\n-\tElectric car charging points,\n-\tLimited parking spaces available,\n-\tPet Wash corner,\n-\tParcel collection service,\n-\tResident App and portal,\n-\tBookable private dining suite and kitchen,\n-\tBookable cinema room,\n-\tRental car on site available to book.\n\nUnique living awaits at Newmarket Yards. Schedule a viewing and discover a world beyond compare! Contact a member of our team today to arrange a personal viewing and see for yourself!\n\nLive the Newmarket Yards dream: Book your viewing today, sign your lease before end of the month and be in with a chance to win vouchers to use in attractions & shops in the area!",
